<title>UK: BTP sets $100 millon debt issue.</title>
<headline>BTP sets $100 millon debt issue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BTP Plc has issued a U.S. Private Placement for $100 million, it said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The notes will have a coupon of 7.53 percent and a 12-year maturity.</p>
<p>The proceeds of the issue will replace short term borrowings used to finance the aquisition of PCR Inc, which was completed in April, it said. --Denise Manning, London newsroom,  +44 171 542 7658</p>
